// tests/fixtures/err_fn_call_arg_count.ubl
// GENERICS_RULES.md — plain function calls never unified arguments
// against declared param types at all before this file (generic or
// not) — `call_return_type` computed and discarded every arg's type.
// `add` takes two params; called here with three.
